Description: Implements the Quantile Augmented Dickey-Fuller (QADF) unit root 
    test following Koenker and Xiao (2004) <doi:10.1198/016214504000000296>. 
    The test extends the standard ADF test to different quantiles of the 
    conditional distribution, allowing for unit root behavior that varies 
    across the distribution. Includes the QKS (Quantile Kolmogorov-Smirnov) 
    supremum test statistic for overall unit root inference, critical values 
    from Hansen (1995), bootstrap p-values, half-life calculations, and 
    visualization tools. Useful for testing purchasing power parity, 
    asymmetric adjustment, and regime-dependent persistence.
